{"availability":"available","full":"alt-ctrl-dev/mosaic-maker","name":"mosaic-maker","description":"🧩 **Mosaic Maker** creates stunning photomosaics and studded brick art right in your browser! 🧱✨  🔒 100% private & offline: all processing runs locally on-device using Web Workers & Canvas—no images leave your machine. 🎨 Features customizable palettes, procedural tiles, device preflight checks & full-res exports (PNG/JPEG/WebP). 🚀","category":"Design","language":"TypeScript","stars":0,"forks":0,"created":"2026-07-12T11:55:41Z","updated":"2026-10-05T00:36:27Z","license":"Apache-2.0","branch":"main","homepage":"https://alt-ctrl-dev.github.io/mosaic-maker/","topics":[],"demo":"https://alt-ctrl-dev.github.io/mosaic-maker/","color":"#302e55","ink":"#dbd2ff","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-06T09:08:40.784Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-06T09:08:40.784Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-06T09:08:40.784Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-04T08:11:23.953Z","stars":0,"forks":0},{"at":"2026-10-06T09:08:40.784Z","stars":0,"forks":0}],"technologies":["React"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["Mosaic Maker is a privacy-focused, in-browser application that transforms source images into full-resolution photomosaics. All processing happens locally in your browser - your images never leave your device.","A photomosaic is a mosaic made up of small photographs, creating a larger composite image. Each small image (called a \"tessera\") contributes to forming the overall picture when viewed from a distance."],"features":["Privacy First: All image processing happens in your browser, nothing is uploaded to any server","Full Resolution Output: Generate high-quality mosaics that maintain the resolution of your source image","Custom Tesserae: Upload your own images or generate random colored tesserae as building blocks","Responsive Design: Works on desktop and mobile devices","Export Options: Download your finished mosaic as a PNG image"],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/alt-ctrl-dev/mosaic-maker/b